OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mostly cloudy day with
OL,6,Fscattered showers, these merging into
OL,7,Fsome longer spells of rain at times
OL,8,Fthis afternoon. Showers occasionally
OL,9,Fheavy. Drier weather into Orkney later
OL,10,Fin the afternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FThere will be variable
OL,13,Famounts of cloud this evening and
OL,14,Fovernight with passing showers,
OL,15,Fperhaps some longer spells of rain
OL,16,Facross Shetland at first. Fresh
OL,17,Fnorthwesterly winds.
OL,18,
OL,19,CFriday:FA few bright spells but often
OL,20,Fcloudy with a few passing showers.
OL,21,FBrisk westerly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
